## Build order
1. tools/ — each tool as standalone testable function (CORTEX DONE)
2. schemas/canonical_alert.py — Pydantic models
3. nodes/correlate.py — Redis + TheHive correlation, no LLM
4. nodes/investigate.py — Agent 1, ReAct, all tools wired
5. nodes/analyze.py — Agent 2, single call, GBNF output
6. nodes/format_output.py — severity table, triage_result builder
7. graph.py — LangGraph state machine wiring all nodes
8. main.py — FastAPI wrapper

